# Insurance layer for beneath-surface files. Redirects in `_redirects` win over
# headers, so while the shield rules are active these headers never fire; they
# exist so a removed or mistyped redirect can never leave an internal file
# indexed. `_headers` itself is consumed at deploy time and never served.
/tools/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/README.md
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/HOW-TO-POST-A-BLOG.md
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/POSTING_GUIDE.md
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/wrangler.jsonc
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
/.gitignore
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
